================================================================================
Third-party software
================================================================================

A complete, machine-generated inventory of every runtime dependency and its
license is shipped with the app and surfaced in-app under
Settings -> Open Source Licenses. The same data is produced at build time by:

    ./gradlew :app:licenseReleaseReport

The report is written to:
    app/build/reports/licenses/licenseReleaseReport.{json,html}

and is also copied into `app/src/main/assets/open_source_licenses.json` for
runtime display.

The list below is a non-authoritative summary of major third-party components.
For the authoritative list, consult the generated report.

